{"campaign_version":"storage-taxonomy-v2-20260813","canonical":{"bri_country":"Yes","category":"综合能源","country":"印度尼西亚","country_iso":"IDN","created_at":"2026-03-23T09:54:42.201921","excluded":0,"excluded_reason":null,"id":"IDN-HB-0015","ldc":"No","location":"Batam","location_norm":null,"name_en_quality":"ai_translated","project_name":"印尼丹绒沙乌300兆瓦智慧能源项目","project_name_en":"Tanjung Sauh 300MW Smart Energy Project","subcategory":null},"events":[{"articles":[{"author":"四川能建工程技术服务有限公司","content":"3月23日，四川能建工程技术服务有限公司与印度尼西亚PT Tanjung Sauh Power公司在成都举行丹绒沙乌300兆瓦智慧能源项目咨询服务合同签约仪式。西南院党委委员、副总经理吴新主持仪式并开展座谈交流。\n丹绒沙乌300兆瓦智慧能源项目是公司与西南院国际公司联合开发成功的经典案例。该项目位于印尼丹绒沙乌工业和经济特区，建成后可缓解巴淡乃至廖内群岛省的电力紧张局面，同时也将持续为工业园区提供稳定的能源供应，助力区域经济社会发展。\n会上，吴新对Sherly Tano董事长一行表示最诚挚的欢迎和热烈的问候，并全方位、多层次回顾了西南院在促进印尼能源发展中取得的丰硕成果。他表示，此次合作，公司将组织技术精湛的服务团队，以“技术法规为纲、安全效能为本”为准则，全力保障项目顺利进行。同时，期待双方以此次合作为新的起点，共同探讨未来合作的新方向和新领域，携手共创更加美好的未来。\nSherly Tano董事长对西南院及公司的热情接待表示衷心感谢，并高度评价了西南院在国内外能源领域的专业水平和技术优势。她表示，PT Tanjung Sauh Power公司后期有大规模的能源建设规划，在本次合作的基础上，希望西南院能从规划引领、技术咨询到EPC深度参与PT Tanjung Sauh Power公司的电站及电网建设，推动双方合作再上新台阶。\nPT Tanjung Sauh Power公司董事长Sherly Tano，公司董事长、总经理李建鹏代表双方签订合同，双方相关人员参加签约仪式。","content_sha256":"012ca2cf43de547713276bb347c33dd80bf4347bf66b6ebc0a879e28014433a9","id":4221,"publish_date":"2025-04-02 10:12:02","title":"四川能建工程技术服务公司签署印尼丹绒沙乌300兆瓦智慧能源项目","title_sha256":"92294df55fe422e888993e6ab0de4c9c5eeb027cc9112ed95625ad67ce093198","url":"https://news.goalfore.cn/topstories/detail/80917.html"}],"event":{"additional_remarks":"","canonical_id":"IDN-HB-0015","capacity_details":"","capacity_mw":300.0,"capacity_mw_raw":"300","capacity_source":"legacy","contract_amount_usd":null,"contract_amount_usd_raw":null,"created_at":"2026-03-23T09:54:42.202141","financing_amount_usd":null,"financing_amount_usd_raw":null,"financing_model":"Unknown","financing_model_details":"","id":"IDN-HB-0015-01","investment_date":"","line_length_km":null,"needs_manual_review":0,"non_official_website_links":"[\"https://www.cpnn.com.cn/news/nyqy/202601/t20260129_1863502.html\"]","official_website_links":"[]","planned_complete_date":"","planned_start_date":"","production_capacity_unit":null,"production_capacity_value":null,"project_developer":"PT Tanjung Sauh Power","project_developer_en":"PT Tanjung Sauh Power","project_stage":"签约","project_summary":"四川能建工程技术服务有限公司参与了印度尼西亚丹绒沙乌300兆瓦智慧能源项目的咨询服务合同签约。该项目位于印尼丹绒沙乌工业和经济特区，旨在缓解当地电力紧张局面并为工业园区提供稳定能源。项目处于签约阶段。","publish_date":"2025-04-02 10:12:02","pv_capacity_mw":null,"source_links":"[\"https://news.goalfore.cn/topstories/detail/80917.html\"]","storage_energy_mwh":null,"storage_power_mw":null,"total_investment_usd":null,"total_investment_usd_raw":"","transmission_capacity_mw":null,"verification_confidence":null,"verification_sources":null,"verification_status":"unverified","voltage_kv":null}},{"articles":[{"author":"东方国际","content":"近日，印尼丹绒韶赫智慧能源电站项目正式生效。该项目位于印尼巴淡岛，建成后将为巴淡岛提供稳定的清洁高效电力，明显改善印尼巴淡特区用电短缺现状，为当地经济发展贡献力量。","content_sha256":"02f83617aed7bdb8061566038ac2bca12d0cf19085aea8a2fd3b6d0c76842e49","id":4841,"publish_date":"2025-02-06 09:34:05","title":"印尼丹绒韶赫智慧能源电站项目正式生效","title_sha256":"50016a5ebc3e73d33e288458ecfa18ba493666251a1a7dcb0fdfe4d574ab1d3f","url":"https://news.goalfore.cn/topstories/detail/78353.html"}],"event":{"additional_remarks":"","canonical_id":"IDN-HB-0015","capacity_details":"","capacity_mw":null,"capacity_mw_raw":"","capacity_source":null,"contract_amount_usd":null,"contract_amount_usd_raw":null,"created_at":"2026-03-23T09:58:10.473412","financing_amount_usd":null,"financing_amount_usd_raw":null,"financing_model":"Unknown","financing_model_details":"","id":"IDN-HB-0015-02","investment_date":"","line_length_km":null,"needs_manual_review":0,"non_official_website_links":"[\"http://www.scio.gov.cn/gxzl/ydyl_26587/zxtj_26590/202507/t20250701_919354.html\"]","official_website_links":"[]","planned_complete_date":"","planned_start_date":"","production_capacity_unit":null,"production_capacity_value":null,"project_developer":"","project_developer_en":null,"pro